  "text": "**Alex:** So, have you heard about the new coffee shop downtown?  \n\n**Jamie:** Yeah, the one with the giant mural? I think it's called *The Bean & Brew*?  \n\n**Alex:** That\u2019s the one. I went in last week, and the avocado toast was *amazing*.  \n\n**Jamie:** Oh, I\u2019ve been meaning to try that. I heard the owner is a local artist.  \n\n**Alex:** Really? That\u2019s cool. I\u2019m not sure I\u2019m a fan of avocado toast, but I\u2019d still go just to see the mural.  \n\n**Jamie:** Totally. I\u2019d love to see it. Did you get a good view from the window?  \n\n**Alex:** Yeah, actually. The sun was hitting the mural just right when I was there. It looked like it was glowing.  \n\n**Jamie:** Wow, that sounds incredible. I wonder if they have any events there?  \n\n**Alex:** I think they do. There was a poetry night last Friday. I didn\u2019t go, but I heard it was pretty packed.  \n\n**Jamie:** Maybe I\u2019ll check it out next week. I could use a little inspiration.  \n\n**Alex:** That\u2019s a good idea. You should come with me sometime. I\u2019ll show you the mural and we can grab a latte.  \n\n**Jamie:** Deal. I\u2019d love that. Just let me know when you\u2019re free.  \n\n**Alex:** No problem. I\u2019ll text you tomorrow.  \n\n**Jamie:** Sounds good. Talk soon!",
